/div>"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{3SAT}\">\\(\\mathrm{3SAT}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{3COLOR}\">\\(\\mathrm{3COLOR}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NPComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span> 采用本目录定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{3COLOR}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\\mathrm{3SAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{3COLOR}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{3COLOR}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\\mathrm{3SAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{3COLOR}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>R6 证据边界：本次只核对习题陈述与提示，完整 3COL 子句部件仍未审计。因此本条保留为有来源的定理记录，不作为本次已完整核验的证明依赖。</p>\n<p>颜色表是多项式长度证据，逐边检查可得 NP 成员资格。NP 难性是原书习题2.21，提示从 3SAT 归约；典型构造用基准三角形与相反颜色的变量顶点，再接子句部件。本次核对了题目及提示，未完整展开或逐图核验该子句部件，因此不把此简述当作已完成的本地构造证明。</p>\n<p>来源核对：习题2.21与提示；印刷66、532页；PDF92、558页。陈述及归约起点已核对；完整部件证明未核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-graph-coloring","status":"resolved","id":"9796412f33541cd3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-graph-coloring]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-3sat","status":"resolved","id":"5408daacba221251","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-3sat]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np-complete","status":"resolved","id":"7a9125ebbfdef91e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","headin